<p class="sub"><a href="/">Deployments</a></p><h1>prod <span class="badge fail">failing</span></h1><p class="sub"><code>compose.yaml</code>, <code>compose.prod.yaml</code></p><h2>Live report</h2><p class="sub">Audited now, fails on error.</p><ul class="counts" aria-label="Findings per severity"><li><span class="badge error">2 errors</span></li><li><span class="badge warning">1 warning</span></li><li><span class="badge info">1 info</span></li><li><span class="badge">2 ignored by configuration</span></li></ul><form class="filters" method="get" role="search" aria-label="Filter findings"><label>Severity<select name="severity"><option value="" selected>All</option><option value="warning">Warnings and errors</option><option value="error">Errors only</option></select></label><label>Service<select name="service"><option value="" selected>All</option><option value="api">api</option><option value="db">db</option></select></label><button type="submit">Filter</button></form><h3>Project</h3><ul class="findings"><li class="finding"><div class="head"><span class="badge info">info</span> <a href="/rules/R017"><code>R017</code></a> <span class="where mono">compose.yaml:1:1</span></div><p>the root `version` key is obsolete</p><p class="fix">Fix: Remove the `version` key</p></li></ul><h3>Service <code>api</code></h3><ul class="findings"><li class="finding"><div class="head"><span class="badge error">error</span> <a href="/rules/R005"><code>R005</code></a> <span class="where mono">compose.yaml:4:5</span></div><p>volume &#39;data&#39; is not declared at the root</p><p class="fix">Fix: Declare &#39;data&#39; under the root `volumes:` key</p></li><li class="finding"><div class="head"><span class="badge warning">warning</span> <a href="/rules/R001"><code>R001</code></a> <span class="where mono">compose.override.yaml:3:7</span></div><p>depends_on &#39;db&#39; does not wait for the service to be healthy</p><p class="fix">Fix: Use `condition: service_healthy` and add a healthcheck to &#39;db&#39;</p></li></ul><h3>Service <code>db</code></h3><ul class="findings"><li class="finding"><div class="head"><span class="badge error">error</span> <a href="/rules/R002"><code>R002</code></a> <span class="where mono">compose.yaml:9:12</span></div><p>image &#39;postgres&#39; has no tag</p><p class="fix">Fix: Pin a version, e.g. `postgres:16.4`</p></li></ul><h2>History</h2><svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 600 160" role="img" aria-labelledby="chart-title" preserveAspectRatio="none"><title id="chart-title">Findings per severity over the last 2 saved reports, from 0 to 2. The table below lists the same values.</title><line class="axis" x1="8" y1="152" x2="592" y2="152"/><polyline class="line error" points="8.0,8.0 592.0,152.0"/><polyline class="line warning" points="8.0,80.0 592.0,152.0"/><polyline class="line info" points="8.0,80.0 592.0,152.0"/></svg><ul class="legend"><li>— errors</li><li>- - warnings</li><li>··· info</li><li>max 2</li></ul><form class="filters" method="get" action="/deployments/prod/compare" aria-label="Compare two reports"><label>From<select name="from"><option value="2026-11-26T11-47-17.123Z" selected>2026-11-26 11:47 UTC</option><option value="2026-11-25T09-12-03.481Z">2026-11-25 09:12 UTC</option></select></label><label>To<select name="to"><option value="live" selected>Live</option><option value="2026-11-26T11-47-17.123Z">2026-11-26 11:47 UTC</option><option value="2026-11-25T09-12-03.481Z">2026-11-25 09:12 UTC</option></select></label><button type="submit">Compare</button></form><div class="table-wrap"><table><caption class="skip">Saved reports, most recent first</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Saved</th><th scope="col">Label</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Errors</th><th scope="col">Warnings</th><th scope="col">Info</th><th scope="col">Ignored</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="/deployments/prod/reports/2026-11-26T11-47-17.123Z">2026-11-26 11:47 UTC</a></td><td></td><td><span class="badge pass">ready</span></td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td><a href="/deployments/prod/reports/2026-11-25T09-12-03.481Z">2026-11-25 09:12 UTC</a></td><td><code>a1b2c3d</code></td><td><span class="badge fail">failing</span></td><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td><code>2026-11-01T00-00-00.000Z</code></td><td colspan="6"><span class="badge unreadable">unreadable</span> invalid SARIF: EOF</td></tr></tbody></table></div></main>
